---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: page-inner page-work
permalink: /work/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
tags: []
title: "Our Work: Website & Marketing Projects | Candor Digital"
description: "Real projects by Candor Digital, Melbourne: a creator-broker brand site, a mortgage tools platform and a men's skincare store. No invented numbers."
tag: "proof, not promises"
heading: "Real projects, <em>built end to end</em>."
lede: "We're a new practice, so the client list is short. Below it are four concept sites we designed to show our range, clearly marked as concepts."
secondaryCta: { label: "See services", url: "/services/" }
breadcrumbs: [{ name: "Work", url: "/work/" }]
---
{% include "page-hero.njk" %}
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="work-preview work-preview--hub">
      {% for c in collections.case %}
      <a class="shot-card reveal" data-reveal href="{{ c.url }}" data-hover>
        <span class="shot-frame"><span class="laptop laptop--mini"><span class="laptop-lid"><span class="laptop-cam" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="laptop-screen"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ c.data.shot | replace('.jpg', '-sm.webp') }} 800w, {{ c.data.shot | replace('.jpg', '-lg.webp') }} {{ c.data.shotW }}w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 80vw, 460px"><img src="{{ c.data.shot }}" alt="{{ c.data.shotAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="889"></picture></span></span><span class="laptop-deck" aria-hidden="true"><span class="laptop-keys"></span><span class="laptop-pad"></span></span></span></span>
        <span class="shot-meta"><b>{{ c.data.client }}</b><span>{{ c.data.lede }}</span></span>
        <span class="shot-tags">{% for t in c.data.servicesUsed %}<i>{{ t }}</i>{% endfor %}</span>
        <span class="card-more">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="concepts" class="concepts alt-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">concept sites</span></div>
      <h2>What we'd build for a business like yours</h2>
      <p class="muted">Four homepages for fictional Melbourne businesses, each with its own type, palette and personality. They aren't clients: they show the range before you trust us with yours. Click one to open the live page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="concept-grid">
      {% for c in concepts %}
      <a class="concept-card reveal" data-reveal href="/work/concepts/{{ c.slug }}/" data-hover>
        <span class="shot-frame"><span class="laptop laptop--mini"><span class="laptop-lid"><span class="laptop-cam" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="laptop-screen"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/work/concepts/{{ c.slug }}-sm.webp 800w, /assets/work/concepts/{{ c.slug }}-lg.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 80vw, 460px"><img src="/assets/work/concepts/{{ c.slug }}.jpg" alt="{{ c.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="889"></picture></span></span><span class="laptop-deck" aria-hidden="true"><span class="laptop-keys"></span><span class="laptop-pad"></span></span></span></span>
        <span class="concept-body">
          <span class="concept-head"><b>{{ c.name }}</b><i>{{ c.trade }} · {{ c.area }}</i></span>
          <span class="swatches">{% for p in c.palette %}<span class="swatch"><span class="chip" style="background:{{ p.hex }}"></span><span class="sw-name">{{ p.name }}</span></span>{% endfor %}</span>
          <span class="concept-intent">{{ c.intent }}</span>
          <span class="card-more">Open the concept <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "cta-band.njk" %}
